0..62 Comment "// This source shows an importer through a flow and two paths."
63..65 Comment "//"
66..145 Comment "// A package moves on while its importers stay. A flow presents a newer package"
146..224 Comment "// at an older signature. This source also defines a flow that adds scaling. A"
225..298 Comment "// renaming presents the newer package at the older signature too. A path"
299..338 Comment "// presents a model in both directions."
339..341 Comment "//"
342..417 Comment "// The checker reads a flow as a functor between theory models. It resolves"
418..495 Comment "// each imported member through the selected flow. A flow member that names a"
496..569 Comment "// domain member alone binds the source\'s declaration, and any other flow"
570..643 Comment "// member is this importer\'s code. A path is two functions between packed"
644..702 Comment "// models. Conversion decides each round trip of a member."
703..705 Comment "//"
706..721 Comment "// - see: #3378"
722..737 Comment "// - see: #3461"
738..753 Comment "// - see: #3487"
